> "azgor" <nowhere.10.azgor@spamgourmet.com> wrote...
> > [15]: Genociding green slimes should prevent you turning into one when
> > slimed. --jmst
> Pardon my ignorance, but how do you get slimed when green slimes are
> already genocided?

The suggestion is that if you get slimed and then genocide green slimes,
you should not turn into a green slime.

If this is implemented, the slimed creature should probably just cease to
exist after the sliming process has finished, in much the same way as
monsters leveling up into a higher-level form get killed if that form has
been genocided.

